      "words": 48
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I know I can't escape; I tried once. Climbed out of my bedroom window in the middle of the night when the fear got so ba",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8863
        },
        {
          "text": "I made it three steps before I saw the dark shape of a security guard walking the perimeter path with a torch",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9056
        }
      ],
      "words": 53
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"You don't fucking communicate with him, Selina. I gave you a task, get to it, you're not on my payroll to stand around ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11575
        }
      ],
      "words": 37
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Soren just grunts. The low sound makes me flinch hard enough that my shoulders jump",
          "ok": true,
